flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[User selects file]
    B --> C{Authenticated?}
    C -- No --> D[Show sign-in required message]
    D --> Z([End])
    C -- Yes --> E[Upload file to API]
    E --> F[Store file on disk]
    F --> G[Create MediaAsset in database]
    G --> H[Queue background task]
    H --> I[Worker starts processing]
    I --> J{Video file?}
    J -- Yes --> K[Extract audio with FFmpeg]
    J -- No --> L[Use audio directly]
    K --> M[Transcribe content]
    L --> M
    M --> N[Generate summary]
    N --> O[Extract entities]
    O --> P[Compare entities with watchlist]
    P --> Q[Store analysis results]
    Q --> R[Set status completed or alerted]
    R --> Z([End])
